OL,3,GNEWSANew-look comedy festival announces
OL,4,A630 shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new-look comedy festival, replacing a
OL,7,Fformer event which was cancelled after
OL,8,Fits parent company ceased trading, has
OL,9,Fannounced 630 shows in Leicester.
OL,11,FThe Independent Comedy Festival has
OL,12,Fconfirmed the shows will take place
OL,13,Fover more than two weeks in February,
OL,14,Fwith 35,000 tickets available across 43
OL,15,Fvenues.
OL,17,FIn August, The Big Difference Company -
OL,18,Fwhich ran Leicester Comedy Festival -
OL,19,Fannounced "with great sadness" that it
OL,20,Fhad become insolvent and ceased
OL,21,Ftrading.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
